// adversarial review of src/jq.ts (destructuring alternatives, strptime,
// path expressions), the same way jq-cases.gen.mjs does for the main cases.
//
//   node test/fixtures/jq-review-cases.gen.mjs     (needs jq 1.7 on PATH; not run in CI)
//
// writes test/fixtures/jq-review-cases.json. strptime is recorded as jq runs
// it on glibc in UTC. Left out: what jq-cases.gen.mjs leaves out, error
// messages (a caught error is replaced by "E"), and strptime directives this
// jq does not read (%C %I %p %U ...) or counts of seconds past 2^53.
